{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-10-19 11:04:00', 'title': 'AEP INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO 78 CENTS A SHARE', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO, OCT. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER CO. (NASDAQ: AEP) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 78 CENTS A SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, AN INCREASE OF 4 CENTS PER SHARE. THE INCREASE IS IN LINE WITH THE COMPANY'S 5% TO 7% OPERATING EARNINGS GROWTH RANGE."}